{"version":1,"content":"<p>「億萬駙馬」伍富橋太太梁兆楹（Shirley）為佢誕下愛子Julian，近日已擺滿月酒，幸福到爆。</p><p>愛運動嘅伍富橋為同大眾分享添丁喜悅，佢除投資經營室內匹克球場（Pickleball）生意，又係明星教練，日前佢上載最新招生海報，開辦成人匹克球</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:21:52.041807+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:01:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:17.569828+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:17.569828+00:00","content_hash":"212ffc995adc505d9d062ffb413ae2defea02ffd7d914d03ef28806105ae4ad8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}